id: drained
name: Drained
kind: condition
description: >
  Having been drained of energy, you have a harder time replenishing the
  energy you have lost.
text: >
  Halve your Surgency and increase the Ki Point Cost of all Attacking
  Maneuvers by 2(T).

---

[passive]
surgency *= 0.5;
attack.kiCost += 2(T);
